flowchart LR
  Dev[Agente / developer] --> CLI[test-harness/bin CLI]
  PK[PipelineK authoritative gates] --> CLI
  CLI --> P[Pure Planner + Policy]
  P --> VAL[Input fingerprint + reuse decision]
  VAL --> EXEC[Execution Supervisor]
  EXEC --> CG[Cargo]
  EXEC --> NX[Nextest opt-in]
  EXEC --> PY[CI contracts]
  EXEC --> SB[Sandbox / Podman]
  CG --> STORE[Append-only receipts]
  NX --> STORE
  PY --> STORE
  SB --> STORE
  STORE --> VAL
  STORE --> AGG[Gate aggregator]
  AGG --> PK
  STATE[XDG state outside Git] --- STORE
  SRC[CogniCode source + Cargo metadata] --> P
